# thesis outputs are tracked on purpose (figures are generated by `make figures`,
# main.pdf is the built paper). These override *.pdf and *.png above.
!Thesis-writeup/Writing/figures/*.pdf
!Thesis-writeup/Writing/figures/*.png
!Thesis-writeup/Writing/build/main.pdf

# LaTeX output belongs in Thesis-writeup/Writing/build, never beside main.tex.
